  "notes": "Released on the same day and in the same post as Gemini 3.6 Flash; the post also announced Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber, which has no record. The model card lists Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite as the model it is based on; recorded as successor-of along the Flash-Lite line. Agent Platform lists a retirement date of July 21, 2027 or later, which is a planned earliest date, not a deprecation; the Gemini API deprecations page lists no shutdown date on 2026-10-01."
